  "description": "WOYFIB crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C66 H76 Cl2 Dy4 Mn2 N6 O22,2(C4 H10 O1),4(C2 H3 N1),3(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Mn1 (Mn) has 3 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Mn2 (Mn) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.536-3.963 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 100.03-112.30°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [{LMn(Cl)(μ3-OH)Dy2(μ3-OH)(μ-Piv)2}2]·2Et2O·4MeCN·3H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
